  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tQuick Guides: Getting Started with Capium\n\n### Two factor authentication\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 10 Nov, 2025 at  3:45 PM\n\n\t\tTo enhance Capium's and your firm's security, we have made Two-Factor Authentication mandatory when logging into Capium for you, your staff, and your clients in order to more effectively protect your data. This is an extra layer of security used to ensure that people trying to gain access to an online account are who they say they are. It adds a second step to the login process, making it harder for unauthorized users to access your account.\n\nUpon entering your email address and password to access the system, a 6-digit OTP code will be sent to your mobile number. After entering your OTP, you will have the option to remember the device for 30 days without any OTP's by selecting the 'Trust the Device' option. If you choose 'Do not Trust', you will be required to enter the OTP again during your next login.\n\nIf you do not have access to the mobile number or if there are delays in receiving the OTP due to unforeseen circumstances such as network coverage issues or restrictions on SMS delivery, you may opt for the 'Try another way' as an alternative.\n\nPlease refer to the screenshot on our application that guides you through the email verification process. This option is available to ensure a seamless process in case of any difficulties with SMS delivery.\n\nWhen you click on 'Try another way', our application will email you the OTP that you can use to log in.\n\nPlease ensure that you routinely clear your browsing history, cookies, and cache to avoid any disruptions when accessing your account. If the issue continues, consider using a different browser or utilizing private browsing modes such as those available in Google Chrome or Microsoft Edge.\n\nIf you encounter any delays in receiving OTPs via email inbox, kindly review the following:\n\n1. Please review the spam or junk folder.\n2. Verify if the same email address has been designated as the primary email.\n3. Verify any subfolders or labels designated for Capium within the email section.\n4. Ensure you possess reliable internet connectivity.\n\nIf issue continue to persist, kindly contact the support team at support@capium.com for additional assistance.\n\nTo change the Two Factor Authentication recovery email address or mobile number, follow these simple steps:\n\n1. Log in to your account and navigate to the My Admin section.\n2. Click on Profile >> Profile Settings to access your account settings.\n3. Select the Two Factor Authentication option from the menu.\n4. Locate the Email Address/Text Message section and click on Edit.\n5. The system will send an OTP to the email or mobile number that you are attempting to modify.\n6. Enter the OTP to confirm.\n7. Enter the new email address/mobile number that you want to use for Two Factor Authentication recovery.\n8. Save the changes.\n\nIf you no longer have access to the current recovery email or mobile number, please send the details that need to be updated to suppot@capium.com, and our team will assist you in updating the information.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have any questions about Two Factor Authentication, please don't hesitate to reach out to our customer support team for assistance. We are here to help you with any concerns or inquiries you may have.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000092543\">General</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000140639\">Quick Guides: Getting Started with Capium</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Two factor authentication\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 10 Nov, 2025 at  3:45 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">To enhance Capium's and your firm's security, we have made Two-Factor Authentication mandatory when logging into Capium for you, your staff, and your clients in order to more effectively protect your data. <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none\">This is an extra layer of security used to ensure that people trying to gain access to an online account are who they say they are. It adds a second step to the login process, making it harder for unauthorized users to access your account.</span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">Upon entering your email address and password to access the system, a 6-digit OTP code will be sent to your mobile number. After entering your OTP, you will have the option to remember the device for 30 days without any OTP's by selecting the 'Trust the Device' option. If you choose 'Do not Trust', you will be required to enter the OTP again during your next login.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">If you do not have access to the mobile number or if there are delays in receiving the OTP due to unforeseen circumstances such as network coverage issues or restrictions on SMS delivery, you may opt for the 'Try another way' as an alternative.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">\n<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">Please refer to the screenshot on our application that guides you through the email verification process. This option is available to ensure a seamless process in case of any difficulties with SMS delivery.</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\">\n<img src=\"https://attachment.freshdesk.com/inline/attachment?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6OTIzOTY1NTQyNiwiZG9tYWluIjoiY2FwaXVtLmZyZXNoZGVzay5jb20iLCJhY2NvdW50X2lkIjozMzQxMjd9.xgDIRUpZM0GTYut7GdE7srfi_OvLTgrWkx4Rjwe3TKY\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; width: auto\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-id=\"9239655426\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\">\n<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">When you click on 'Try another way', our application will email you the OTP that you can use to log in.</span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\">\n<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"><img src=\"https://attachment.freshdesk.com/inline/attachment?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6OTIzOTY1NTQyOSwiZG9tYWluIjoiY2FwaXVtLmZyZXNoZGVzay5jb20iLCJhY2NvdW50X2lkIjozMzQxMjd9.lGox3ww03RlLgLJC8bkG-QrXCHuAvnPn6f4MKaIqRVU\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; width: auto\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-id=\"9239655429\">\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\">Please ensure that you routinely clear your browsing history, cookies, and cache to avoid any disruptions when accessing your account. If the issue continues, consider using a different browser or utilizing private browsing modes such as those available in Google Chrome or Microsoft Edge.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><strong>If you encounter any delays in receiving OTPs via email inbox, kindly review the following:</strong></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">1. Please review the spam or junk folder.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">2. Verify if the same email address has been designated as the primary email.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">3. Verify any subfolders or labels designated for Capium within the email section.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">4. Ensure you possess reliable internet connectivity.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">If issue continue to persist, kindly contact the support team at <a href=\"mailto:support@capium.com\" rel=\"noreferrer\">support@capium.com</a> for additional assistance.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><br></div>\n<div><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><strong>To change the Two Factor Authentication recovery email address or mobile number, follow these simple steps:</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">1. Log in to your account and navigate to the My Admin section.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">2. Click on Profile &gt;&gt; Profile Settings to access your account settings.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">3. Select the Two Factor Authentication option from the menu.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">4. Locate the Email Address/Text Message section and click on Edit.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">5. The system will send an OTP to the email or mobile number that you are attempting to modify.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">6. Enter the OTP to confirm.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">7. Enter the new email address/mobile number that you want to use for Two Factor Authentication recovery.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">8. Save the changes.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\">If you no longer have access to the current recovery email or mobile number, please send the details that need to be updated to <a href=\"mailto:suppot@capium.com,\" rel=\"noreferrer\">suppot@capium.com,</a> and our team will assist you in updating the information.</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box\"></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">If you encounter any issues or have any questions about Two Factor Authentication, please don't hesitate to reach out to our customer support team for assistance. We are here to help you with any concerns or inquiries you may have.</span></div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000272207\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000272207/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id